PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FTwo weeks after what has been dubbed
OL,8,F'Europe's worst ever nurdle pollution
OL,9,Fincident' on the River Tyne, the Port
OL,10,Fof Tyne (POT) has told ITV News Tyne
OL,11,FTees it will encourage volunteers to
OL,12,Fhelp with the river clean-up, but only
OL,13,F"where it is safe to do so".
OL,15,FBosses at the POT met with a group of
OL,16,Fvolunteers on Monday (3 August)
OL,17,Fmorning to discuss "safe areas" of the
OL,18,Friver they might be able to access to
OL,19,Fcontribute to the operation.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@[O]yD@TOUyD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FIt followed an open letter sent on
OL,8,FFriday which requested experienced
OL,9,Fmembers of the group be allowed to
OL,10,Fassist in the clean-up of the River
OL,11,FTyne.
OL,13,FVolunteers' Open Letter
OL,15,FThe 'Nurdle Clean Up Communities' of
OL,16,FNorth Shields, South Shields,
OL,17,FNorthumberland and Sunderland, put
OL,18,Fmore than 2,000 signatures on the open
OL,19,Fletter to CEO of the POT, Matt Beeton.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FIn it the group expressed its
OL,8,F"outrage" over what it deemed the
OL,9,FPOT's "inadequate response" to the
OL,10,Fincident on Sunday 19 July, which
OL,11,Finvolved a collision between two ships
OL,12,Fand collapsing of a gantry crane.
OL,14,FOne port worker was taken to hospital
OL,15,Fwith injuries described as non-life-
OL,16,Fthreatening, and an estimated one
OL,17,Fbillion nurdle plastic pellets were
OL,18,Fspilled into the water.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@IO]qD@GOUqD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FThe letter also alleged there had been
OL,8,Fan "inaction at the source", claiming
OL,9,Fthe "vast majority of nurdles washing
OL,10,Fonto local beaches originate from
OL,11,Ffloating plumes trapped in the river
OL,12,Fand harbour areas" and that "cleaning
OL,13,Fbeaches without clearing the river is
OL,14,Fan endless cycle".
OL,16,FThe group claimed "recent closures" of
OL,17,Fthe River Tyne for "crane and vessel
OL,18,Fsalvage" had "yielded minimal visible
OL,19,Fnurdle recovery" and had left
OL,20,F"millions of pellets floating
OL,21,Funchecked".
OL,26,@pD@DOUpD@[O]qD@EOUtD@RO]tD@]OUvD@QO]xD@
OL,26,ASOUxD@cO]yD@TOUzD@HO]zD@NOU{D@PO]|D@AOU
OL,26,B}D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FThe main thrust of the letter was a
OL,8,Frequest by the group to the POT to
OL,9,F"accept assistance from experienced
OL,10,Flocal water folk networks, including
OL,11,Ftrained rescue teams, kayakers, and
OL,12,Fvessel operators ready to assist".
OL,14,FThe group said the environmental
OL,15,Fimpact of the pellets is "profound"
OL,16,Fand will only be "felt for generations
OL,17,Fto come".
OL,26,@qD@AOUtD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FIn the letter, it was suggested: "Once
OL,8,Freleased into the marine environment,
OL,9,Fnurdles are often mistaken for food
OL,10,Fand ingested by seabirds, fish, and
OL,11,Fmarine mammals, causing harm
OL,12,Fthroughout the ecosystem.
OL,14,F"Their effects become even more severe
OL,15,Fover time, as the pellets absorb toxic
OL,16,Fpollutants from the surrounding water
OL,17,Fand are passed up the food chain
OL,18,Fthrough bioaccumulation."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FWatch North East Mayor, Kim
OL,8,FMcGuinness' urge Port of Tyne to
OL,9,Flisten to 'reasonable request' from
OL,10,Fnurdle clean-up volunteers
OL,12,F'Reasonable request', says North East
OL,13,FMayor
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FThe North East Mayor, Kim McGuinness,
OL,8,Fresponded positively to the
OL,9,Fvolunteers' letter, telling ITV News:
OL,10,F"I think it's reasonable for them to
OL,11,Fmake their ask of the Port of Tyne and
OL,12,FI hope they get a good response, and
OL,13,Fsomething that shows that the Port is
OL,14,Flistening to that request, because the
OL,15,Furgency with which we have to deal
OL,16,Fwith this crisis, you know, it's very
OL,17,Fobvious.
OL,26,@rD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,F"You only have to spend time either on
OL,8,Fthe beach or anywhere near the river
OL,9,Fand you can see the impact it's
OL,10,Fhaving."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G9/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FShe said that the volunteering effort
OL,8,Fover the past two weeks had been
OL,9,F"absolutely astounding", adding: "Not
OL,10,Fonly have they turned up in their
OL,11,Fthousands to help with the clean up
OL,12,Feffort, but they've educated
OL,13,Fthemselves very quickly on the impact
OL,14,Fof these nurdles and also how to
OL,15,Frecover them, and I think that's
OL,16,Fincredibly impressive, and nothing
OL,17,FI've seen this volunteer group ask for
OL,18,Fhas been unreasonable.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@WO]qD@bOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G10/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,F"They requested better signage,
OL,8,Fcollection points, we've been able to
OL,9,Farrange that, more information on what
OL,10,Fthe professional clean up looks like,
OL,11,Fand I'll be putting more information
OL,12,Fout on what I've received from the
OL,13,Fcompanies, who are funding that clean
OL,14,Fup".
OL,16,FPort of Tyne response
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@CO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G11/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39712
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FResponding to the mayor's calls, Matt
OL,8,FBeeston told ITV News: "We as much as
OL,9,Fanyone want the river to be cleaned up
OL,10,Fas soon as possible and it has been
OL,11,Fbrilliant to see the region come
OL,12,Ftogether in the cleanup operation.
OL,14,F"From the moment it was safe to do so,
OL,15,Fwe have been highly active in
OL,16,Faccessing and securing the split
OL,17,Fcontainers to prevent a further 33
OL,18,Ftonnes of pellets entering the water,
OL,19,Fwhilst we engaged specialist
OL,20,Fenvironmental cleanup experts Ambipar
OL,21,Fto support containment and cleanup.
OL,26,@pD@XOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G12/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39713
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,F"They have had teams out every day
OL,8,Fcollecting nurdles using floating
OL,9,Fpontoon platforms and nets, which is
OL,10,Fdeemed the most effective method of
OL,11,Fcollection.
OL,13,F"We fully welcome the support of
OL,14,Fvolunteers and will be encouraging
OL,15,Fthem to help, where it is safe to do
OL,16,Fso, in a coordinated and managed way."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUxD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G13/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39714
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FMr Beeston added that the Port of Tyne
OL,8,Fhad been "heavily involved in the
OL,9,Fcoordinated response" and has been in
OL,10,Fdaily contact throughout with the
OL,11,FNorth East Mayoral Strategic
OL,12,FAuthority, local authorities and other
OL,13,Fagencies.
OL,15,FHowever, he fell short of agreeing to
OL,16,Fthe volunteers' request fully, by
OL,17,Freferencing "safety reasons" when
OL,18,Fdeclining them access to the main
OL,19,Fshipping channel.
OL,26,@pD@JOUqD@UO]yD@MOUyD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G14/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39715
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,FHe said this was due to "large
OL,8,Fcommercial vessels using it" and
OL,9,Fstating that the Port also "needs to
OL,10,Fensure the local and regional
OL,11,Fbusinesses that rely on the river can
OL,12,Fcontinue to operate unhindered".
OL,14,FMr Beeton said: "We want to engage
OL,15,Fwith communities to discuss what and
OL,16,Fwhere is safe because safety must
OL,17,Fremain our priority.
OL,26,@oD@YOUpD@\O]qD@\OUtD@_O]vD@QOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G15/16
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39716
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786189686
OL,3,CPort of Tyne to encourage public's
OL,4,Chelp in nurdle clean-up but only
OL,5,C'where safe'
OL,7,F"We are currently assessing safe areas
OL,8,Fwhere we hope volunteers will be able
OL,9,Fto access, and we will release more
OL,10,Fdetails on that shortly".
OL,12,FVolunteers will soon be able to report
OL,13,Fsightings along the river to the Port
OL,14,Fof Tyne, in order to direct the
OL,15,Fcleanup operation in a "targeted
OL,16,Ffashion".
OL,26,@rD@XO]wD@XOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G16/16
